26 has definitely been overdue for approximately 18 days now. The other tasks I should focus on are the weekly recurring one for hotel operations data and the supervisor task that handles daily checks - these are the active items to track.\n\nMost of the other tasks in the list appear to be abandoned or stale, with due dates ranging from January to February 2026. I need to be careful about which ones I mark as dead versus which ones might still be relevant.\n\nThe daily recurring task is overdue - it was due on February 3rd and we're now in mid-April, so that's roughly 44 days past due. Since this is a recurring task that was meant to run daily, I should check if there's a pattern here or if this task should be marked as abandoned as well. The daily task监督与检查 task hasn't been updated since January 30th, which puts it about 18 days overdue. I should mark it as dead in the system. The weekly task for hotel operations data appears to still be active based on the updated timestamp from early April, so I'll keep that one. Now I need to look into the shared pool progress management system."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_a4dql92jqcsk_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table","arguments":{"action":"list","app_token":"ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776424286010,"responseId":"0631485e28af95efe671f4f2870f299d"}}
